                                                "sense_id": "99ad9188-eb3f-30a0-82b6-fd18799ebf28",
                                                "text": "When reading clock pulses only, the signal frequency is 625 kHz. The bit rate, however, is twice the signal frequency, or 1.25 megabits/sec."
